      "review_source": "google"
    },
    {
      "name": "Don Martin",
      "text": "The Maven crew and all involved in the 101 Curry Ct Hubert project definitley earned themselves a 10 star rating. Dedication and unwavering work ethics and proffessionalism with a \"can do\" attitude is highly appreciated. We will always recommend Maven. Thank.you all for a job well done Donald Martin USMC. (ret)",
      "body": "The Maven crew and all involved in the 101 Curry Ct Hubert project definitley earned themselves a 10 star rating. Dedication and unwavering work ethics and proffessionalism with a \"can do\" attitude is highly appreciated. We will always recommend Maven. Thank.you all for a job well done Donald Martin USMC. (ret)",
      "rating": null,
      "date": "",
      "relative_date": "",
      "source": "google",
      "review_source": "google"
    },
    {
      "name": "Amy A",
      "text": "I recently moved to the Swansboro, North Carolina area. Unfortunately I discovered my roof was leaking and I needed to find someone who could be here in a timely manner and do a good job. After several calls to roofers in the area (and beyond) I chose Maven Roofing. After a lot of discussions, thought and consideration, I decided to replace the entire roof as it would be the best thing to do. Having peace of mind was a big factor. I’ve owned several homes and have had to put a new roof on a few of them. I have to say that my experience with Maven is by far the best experience I’ve ever had! Everyone, from start to finish, that I spoke with was friendly, courteous and quite knowledgeable. Every question I asked was answered quickly and with precise expertise. The crew was especially hard-working, courteous and always had a smile for me! Their craftsmanship was top notch! From the moment they started working, I knew I had made the right choice! They certainly went above and beyond my expectations! Nothing is more comforting than knowing that you have a solid roof over your head, especially being so close to the water where we all know the weather can be pretty harsh at times. I thank everyone at Maven for a job well done and commend them on their excellence! I highly recommend them for any of your roofing needs! Sincerely, Amy A",
      "body": "I recently moved to the Swansboro, North Carolina area. Unfortunately I discovered my roof was leaking and I needed to find someone who could be here in a timely manner and do a good job. After several calls to roofers in the area (and beyond) I chose Maven Roofing. After a lot of discussions, thought and consideration, I decided to replace the entire roof as it would be the best thing to do. Having peace of mind was a big factor. I’ve owned several homes and have had to put a new roof on a few of them. I have to say that my experience with Maven is by far the best experience I’ve ever had! Everyone, from start to finish, that I spoke with was friendly, courteous and quite knowledgeable. Every question I asked was answered quickly and with precise expertise. The crew was especially hard-working, courteous and always had a smile for me! Their craftsmanship was top notch! From the moment they started working, I knew I had made the right choice! They certainly went above and beyond my expectations! Nothing is more comforting than knowing that you have a solid roof over your head, especially being so close to the water where we all know the weather can be pretty harsh at times. I thank everyone at Maven for a job well done and commend them on their excellence! I highly recommend them for any of your roofing needs! Sincerely, Amy A",
      "rating": null,
